        <mxCell id="w3" value="JSON: users, config, alerts, presence&#xa;  Atomic: tmpfile &#x2192; fsync &#x2192; os.replace&#xa;TXT Logs: detection, system, voice, danger&#xa;  Rotate at 10 MB &#xb7; 7-day retention&#xa;SQLite: event queue (offline-resilient)&#xa;Clips: AES-256-CBC &#x2192; SFTP exfil" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontStyle=1;fontSize=9;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
